# The store's reads of a file's size, on its parent's: MSVC's <filesystem>
# combines its stats flags, an enum of flags declared without their
# combinations, in file_size, which the analyzer reads as a cast out of
# the enum's range; sizes.cpp holds the store's every file_size call.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >-
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
